Week 7 Project Report

Score System & Procedural Map Generation

1. Introduction

In Week 7, the main focus was to make the Chicken Cross Road game more dynamic and challenging. A score system was added to track the player's progress. A level generator was also implemented to generate random road and river sections. The game difficulty increases as the player's score increases.


---

2. Objective

The main objective of Week 7 was to:

Add a score calculation system.

Track the player's progress.

Generate random road and river sections.

Increase the game difficulty gradually.

Make the game world more dynamic.



---

3. Activities Completed

The following features were implemented during Week 7:

1. Created Score.java.


2. Added score increase when the player moves forward.


3. Displayed the score on the game screen.


4. Created LevelGenerator.java.


5. Added random Road/River section generation.


6. Connected the level generator with TileManager.


7. Added increasing difficulty based on score.


8. Increased car and log speeds at higher scores.


9. Reset the score when the player dies.




