11. Challenges and Solutions

Challenge 1: Random section generation

Generating a new section every game frame would cause continuous random changes.

Solution:
The section generation was connected with player movement so that a new section is generated when the player moves forward.

Challenge 2: Increasing difficulty

The game needed to become harder as the player progressed.

Solution:
Car and log speeds were increased based on the player's score.

Challenge 3: Maintaining the existing game system

The new Week 7 features needed to work with the existing river, log, car, and collision systems.

Solution:
Score, LevelGenerator, and TileManager were integrated into the existing GamePanel without removing the previous game mechanics.


